{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）早上6時41分，警方接報粉嶺一鳴路近百和路交界發生交通意外，一部單車與私家車相撞。救援人員接報趕抵現場，男單車手腳部擦傷，由救護車送往北區醫院治理。</p><p>網上圖片可見，黑色私家車車頭盡毀，泵把幾乎脫落，單車則被卡在私家車車頭，車上雜物散落一地。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"交通警員在場調查。（香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197453799074041856871230.jpeg/sNduExFaV1AKQsGQamE2wiy947RnmQGsEW-cWBFvnFg\"/><figcaption>交通警員在場調查。（香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺) 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黑色私家車車頭盡毀，泵把幾乎脫落。（William Wong/香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺) 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197453801766916096879620.jpeg/KTh46RU7vyUHBQD1DK3OHsa1HhPR01rbu3KYMbtymDE\"/><figcaption>黑色私家車車頭盡毀，泵把幾乎脫落。（William Wong/香港_北區之友 Friends of North District HK(上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺) 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:44.565321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:42:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:00:18.729464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:59:58.164723+00:00","content_hash":"3908a4398b58c319364c3dbe2571c4a161891d27ccedce4045c0e92bedfd9b53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}